{"_meta":{"securitySchemes":[{"type":"noauth"},{"scopes":["scoreboards:write"],"type":"oauth2"}]},"annotations":{"destructiveHint":false,"idempotentHint":true,"openWorldHint":true,"readOnlyHint":false},"description":"Create a public, shareable two-team scoreboard at zero. Requires explicit user intent to create; title and team names are public. Works without signing in: the result then includes a private claim.url (valid up to seven days) for the person who will keep score; it lets them score in the browser and keep the board. Share links.spectator with viewers. A board made without a connection cannot be updated by later tool calls; connect an account first if you need to keep score. Free boards allow 50 total spectator views and show branding. With a connection, retry the identical requestId and input after a timeout; without one, a retry creates another board.","execution":{"taskSupport":"forbidden"},"inputSchema":{"$schema":"http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#","additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"requestId":{"pattern":"^[A-Za-z0-9_-]{8,128}$","type":"string"},"teams":{"items":[{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"name":{"$ref":"#/properties/title"}},"required":["name"],"type":"object"},{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"name":{"$ref":"#/properties/title"}},"required":["name"],"type":"object"}],"maxItems":2,"minItems":2,"type":"array"},"title":{"maxLength":100,"minLength":1,"type":"string"}},"required":["requestId","title","teams"],"type":"object"},"name":"create_scoreboard","outputSchema":{"$schema":"http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#","additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"capabilities":{"items":{"type":"string"},"type":"array"},"claim":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"expiresAt":{"type":"number"},"url":{"type":"string"}},"required":["url","expiresAt"],"type":"object"},"connection":{"const":"guest","type":"string"},"id":{"type":"string"},"limits":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"spectatorViews":{"t